//>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
//      Cubic Shadow Mapping( Object ).
//
//              Parallax mapped.
//              Shadow mapped.
//              Specular mapped. ( lyon )
//              Supports alpha.
//
//      Written By Geoff Wilson.
//>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>

